方物十一月苻堅將楊安䧟梓潼及梁益二州刺史周仲孫帥騎五千南遁"}]},"rights":"古代正文；數位轉錄保留Kanripo來源歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/","explicit_year_context":{"source_lines":[140,154],"raw_quote":"寧康元年春正月己丑朔改元二月大司馬桓温来朝¶\n三月癸丑詔除丹陽竹格等四桁税夏五月旱秋七月¶\n己亥使持節侍中都督中外諸軍事丞相録尚書大司¶\n馬揚州牧平北將軍徐兖二州刺史南郡公桓温薨庚¶\n<pb:KR2a0015_WYG_009-8b>¶\n戌進右將軍桓豁為征西將軍以江州刺史桓沖為中¶\n軍將軍都督揚豫江三州諸軍事揚州刺史鎮姑孰八¶\n月壬子崇徳太后臨朝攝政九月苻堅將楊安寇成都¶\n景申以尚書僕射王彪之為尚書令吏部尚書謝安為¶\n尚書僕射吳國内史刁彛為北中郎將徐兖二州刺史¶\n鎮廣陵復置光禄勲大司農少府官冬十月西平公張¶\n天錫貢方物十一月苻堅將楊安䧟梓潼及梁益二州¶\n<pb:KR2a0015_WYG_009-9a>¶\n刺史周仲孫帥騎五千南遁¶\n二年春正月癸未朔大赦追封諡故㑹稽世子郁為臨¶","next_year_boundary":"二年"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-074","source_id":"s-jinshu-074-ws1536331","source":{"provider":"Wikisource","revision_id":1536331,"permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷074&oldid=1536331","edition":null,"image_verified":false,"qualification":"固定數位傳世文字見證；未親核底本或影像，校勘ref另層。","selected_raw_start":299,"selected_raw_end":9662,"extent":"完整選定傳記單元 huan-family；非全書、非全卷","rights":"古代正文公版；維基文庫數位整理保留來源歸屬及CC BY-SA資格。","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"Balanced wiki display parser; every selected raw codepoint classified as retained visible text, explicit display markup, apparatus ref or unit/navigation metadata. Encoded ! first argument retained; all suffix after closing template preserved.","parser":"wikitext_visible.py"},"title":"晉書／桓彝及附桓氏家族完整單元","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷074&oldid=1536331","raw_file_sha256":"7bda6727ecfc8408408ee49fb5d8a7ef3062666e54535355b3d51b8517fcd925","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-1536331-raw.wikitext","accessed_on":"2026-10-20","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astr